I heard that the staff had a little bit of a chat with you.

543
00:23:08,362 --> 00:23:11,362
I don't know what the unit of severity is.

544
00:23:11,362 --> 00:23:15,362
Actually, there is a color meter to standardize it.

545
00:23:15,362 --> 00:23:21,362
The maximum is 5, but the restaurant I just visited has a 4.8 color meter.

546
00:23:21,362 --> 00:23:23,362
The human limit is 5.

547
00:23:23,362 --> 00:23:28,362
The one that is ranked about 20th in the nation's spicy food ranking.

548
00:23:28,362 --> 00:23:32,362
The last one was exactly 4 color meters.

549
00:23:32,362 --> 00:23:35,362
The last one, Maboku, is about 670th.

550
00:23:35,362 --> 00:23:38,362
I ate spicy food to the human limit.

551
00:23:38,362 --> 00:23:40,362
See, if you think of it as a shonen manga, right?

552
00:23:40,362 --> 00:23:41,362
Yes, yes, yes.

553
00:23:41,362 --> 00:23:42,362
Once Vegeta's.Once Vegeta's. 

554
00:23:42,362 --> 00:23:43,362
Roll it up.

555
00:23:43,362 --> 00:23:45,362
Like this, save and save.

556
00:23:45,362 --> 00:23:48,362
We're going to do it so that we can get revenge on that place, right?

557
00:23:48,362 --> 00:23:51,362
After the 10th meeting, we'll go back there again.

558
00:23:51,362 --> 00:23:52,362
What kind of restaurant?

559
00:23:52,362 --> 00:23:53,362
Fujisaki's.

560
00:23:53,362 --> 00:23:55,362
Why me?

561
00:23:56,362 --> 00:23:58,362
What else do you dislike, Fujisaki?

562
00:23:58,362 --> 00:24:01,362
What's your pet peeve? Screaming.

563
00:24:01,362 --> 00:24:02,362
Screaming?

564
00:24:02,362 --> 00:24:03,362
Screaming scares me.

565
00:24:03,362 --> 00:24:05,362
We've just decided on a location.

566
00:24:06,362 --> 00:24:08,362
The one I asked for.

567
00:24:08,362 --> 00:24:10,362
I wanted to ask for the Mother Farm location.

568
00:24:11,362 --> 00:24:13,362
Screaming. It's a scream, isn't it?

569
00:24:13,362 --> 00:24:15,362
I'll do it. I finally did it.

570
00:24:21,362 --> 00:24:31,362
Next time preview

571
00:24:31,930 --> 00:24:36,930
Thank you for watching until the end. This time it's a dog version!

572
00:24:55,674 --> 00:24:59,674
Ready, go!
